### =====================================================================
### matreko-server M1 登录鉴权体系 —— 接口联调测试（VS Code REST Client 版）
### =====================================================================
### 运行环境：VS Code + REST Client 插件（扩展 ID: humao.rest-client）
### 使用方式：
###   1. 先在 VS Code 扩展市场安装 "REST Client"
###   2. 打开本文件，按 ### 编号顺序逐步执行（点请求上方的 "Send Request"）
###   3. 每次执行后，把响应中的关键值手动填到顶部对应变量，再执行下一步
### 服务地址：localhost:3000（.env 中 PORT 配置），如需改端口改 @host。
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:3000
@platformEmail = admin@platform.example
@platformPassword = Admin12345
# 主管邮箱与设备指纹，可按需修改（改后同步修改后面请求中的引用）
@supervisorEmail = sup_lyq@matreko.local
@fingerprintA = fp-test-mac-001
@fingerprintB = fp-test-win-002

# ── 以下为动态变量，执行到对应步骤后手动回填 ──
# 填第1.1步响应的 data.token
@platformToken = kSiqfAX17ZNdO25-Jl8vwClXYWkjiqWcSLs9OYHiTwc
# 填第2.1步响应的 data.supervisor.id
@supervisorId = cmt6p5lz50005uos9vifwe750
# 填第2.1步响应的 data.initialPassword（仅此一次返回，勿丢） 
@supervisorPassword = NjLa8Hptr45T
# 填第2.1步响应的 data.team.id
@teamId = cmt6p5lz40003uos9h8o524i3
# 填第3.1步响应的 data.token
@supervisorToken = hnNiJkJVa7wH9GgUJi7QBGQQrgNAHn3p89OolsKEO3E
# 填第4.1步响应的 data.licenseKey.id
@licenseKeyId = cmt6p7881000buos9i1zrlwmu
# 填第4.1步响应的 data.plaintextCode（仅此一次返回，勿丢）
@licenseCode = MTRK-JR3T-W3JF-2ECW-BVZJ
# 填第5.1步响应的 data.accessToken
@clientAccessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..RearOvlMMnaTFx9e5dnM2B4QQ9QLRETOi3yW5hq9pSE
# 填第5.1步响应的 data.refreshToken
@clientRefreshToken = hpyh1Z3p1Vavsxmu4efP7AQN8T_cQvj2N5nCE1Z0OXs
# 填第5.1步响应的 data.device.id
@bindingAId = cmt6pdvqb000euos98w5l7u0n
# 填第7.2步响应的 data.device.id
@bindingBId = 

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 0：健康检查（可选）
### =====================================================================

### 0.1 查看 OpenAPI 文档（确认服务在线）
GET {{host}}/api-docs.json

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 1：平台管理员登录
### =====================================================================

### 1.1 平台管理员登录 → 把响应的 data.token 填入顶部 @platformToken
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{platformEmail}}",
  "password": "{{platformPassword}}"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 2：创建团队（平台管理员）
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 创建团队 → 回填 @supervisorId / @supervisorPassword / @teamId
###     注意：initialPassword 仅此一次返回，库中只存哈希，切勿丢失
POST {{host}}/api/platform/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "华东客服一组_0819",
  "supervisorEmail": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00+08:00",
  "portQuota": 10,
  "translationQuota": 1500000
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 3：主管登录
### =====================================================================

### 3.1 主管登录（用 2.1 返回的邮箱 + initialPassword）→ 回填 @supervisorToken
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{supervisorPassword}}"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 4：密钥管理（主管）
### =====================================================================

### 4.1 生成密钥 → 回填 @licenseKeyId / @licenseCode（明文仅此一次返回）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "客服E",
  "multiDeviceEnabled": true
}

### 4.2 密钥列表（确认当前 1 条 UNUSED）
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 4.3 密钥统计（总数 / 已激活 / 未激活 / 已禁用）
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 5：客户端激活与查询
### =====================================================================

### 5.1 设备A 激活（密钥 + 指纹）→ 回填 @clientAccessToken / @clientRefreshToken / @bindingAId
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprintA}}",
  "deviceLabel": "测试机-Mac"
}

### 5.2 客户端查询当前账号（需 accessToken + 指纹，两者都要求）
GET {{host}}/api/client/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}

### 5.3 客户端查询团队配额使用情况
GET {{host}}/api/client/team/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 6：凭据续期（无缝续期）
### =====================================================================

### 6.1 用 refresh token 换新凭据 → 回填 @clientAccessToken / @clientRefreshToken
###     旧的 access/refresh 立即作废；60 秒宽限期内旧 access 仍放行
POST {{host}}/api/client/auth/renew
Authorization: Bearer {{clientRefreshToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6.2 用续期后的新 access 访问（验证新凭据可用）
GET {{host}}/api/client/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}

### 6.3 客户端登出（撤销当前凭据；执行后该 access 失效）
POST {{host}}/api/client/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 7：多设备开关（AC9）
### =====================================================================

### 7.1 开启多开（上限 5 台）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/multi-device
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### 7.2 设备B 激活（第二台设备，需多开已开启）→ 回填 @bindingBId
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprintB}}",
  "deviceLabel": "测试机-Windows"
}

### 7.3 关闭多开但未指定保留设备 → 预期 409 STATUS_CHANGED（AC9 拒绝）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/multi-device
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### 7.4 关闭多开并保留设备A → 204（设备B 凭据被下线）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/multi-device
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false,
  "keepDeviceBindingId": "{{bindingAId}}"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 8：禁用密钥（AC7）
### =====================================================================

### 8.1 密钥活跃且有绑定，未确认直接禁用 → 预期 409 STATUS_CHANGED
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8.2 确认后禁用 → 204（所有设备凭据失效）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": true
}

### 8.3 禁用后重新激活 → 预期 403 KEY_DISABLED（禁用态不可激活，断权验证）
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprintA}}",
  "deviceLabel": "测试机-Mac"
}

### 8.4 启用密钥（密钥可禁用/可启用）→ 有绑定设备恢复为 ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses/{{licenseKeyId}}/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 8.5 设备A 重新激活 → 成功（alreadyActivated=true, reissued=true，补发新凭据）
###     回填 @clientAccessToken / @clientRefreshToken（旧的已失效）
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprintA}}",
  "deviceLabel": "测试机-Mac"
}

### 8.6 用补发的新凭据访问（验证已恢复可用）
GET {{host}}/api/client/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprintA}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 9：设备解绑（主管）
### =====================================================================

### 9.1 解绑设备A（密钥已重新启用、绑定仍在，可解绑）→ 200
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/devices/{{bindingAId}}/unbind
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9.2 密钥列表（确认设备绑定已清空、状态为 ACTIVE）
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 10：登出
### =====================================================================

### 10.1 主管登出
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 10.2 平台管理员登出
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}


### =====================================================================
### 可选：管理功能演示（会改变账号状态，建议主流程跑完后再单独执行）
### =====================================================================

### A.1 平台重置主管密码（需重新登录平台获取 token；重置后主管旧会话全部失效）
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{supervisorId}}",
  "newPassword": "NewSupPass123"
}

### B.1 平台禁用主管账号（禁用后该主管所有会话失效，无法再登录）
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/disable-account
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{supervisorId}}"
}

### C.1 主管修改密码（改后其余会话失效，当前会话保留；需先重新登录主管）
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{supervisorPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "NewSupPass123"
}

### D.1 平台管理员修改密码（改后其余平台会话失效，当前会话保留）
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{platformPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "NewAdminPass123"
}
